At the {{Interlanguage link|12=draft|Ryūkomyō Shrine|ja|龍口明神社}}, she is considered the ancestor of the [[Sea People (Japan)|Kaijin Tribe]], which unites [[Ryūjin|Ryujin]], and the princess herself is worshipped as Ryujin.<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://gozuryu.com/gosaishin.php/%E5%BE%A1%E7%A5%AD%E7%A5%9E|title=御祭神&#124;龍口明神社|website=gozuryu.com}}</ref>
